%[text] | ![Image of a ramp edge with a horizontal line drawn across.](text:image:0d53) | <p>**In this script, students will...**</p><p>$\\bullet${"altText":"\bullet"} identify and describe the characteristics and sources of edges.</p><p>$\\bullet${"altText":"\bullet"} characterize edges in 1D and 2D.</p><p>$\\bullet${"altText":"\bullet"} detect edges amid noise.</p><p></p> | <p>**Academic disciplines**</p><p>$\\bullet${"altText":"\bullet"} Computer Vision</p><p>$\\bullet${"altText":"\bullet"} Image Processing</p><p>$\\bullet${"altText":"\bullet"} Medical Imaging</p><p> </p><p></p> |
