%[text] ### [**Optical Flow**](file:Scripts/OpticalFlow.m)
%[text:table]{"ignoreHeader":true}
%[text] | ![The motion color intensity map of a robot, showing motion with bright and dark hues.](text:image:8686) | <p>**In this script, students will...**</p><p>$\\bullet${"altText":"\bullet"} examine assumptions underlying optical flow theory.</p><p>$\\bullet${"altText":"\bullet"} implement optical flow algorithms for motion detection.</p><p>$\\bullet${"altText":"\bullet"} compare and contrast optical flow techniques.</p><p></p> | <p>**Academic disciplines**</p><p>$\\bullet${"altText":"\bullet"} Computer Vision</p><p>$\\bullet${"altText":"\bullet"} Image Processing</p> |
